WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:01,910
lady

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:05,200
You seem to really don't want us in, brother

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,480
Why did Wang Ma keep so many Han people?

4
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:10,030
Maybe it's because of a guilty conscience, Fourth Young Master?

5
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:11,620
What does hang mean

6
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,420
Now that the yoyo has stopped

7
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:15,420
Just let the landscape come in and take a look

8
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,940
Those who are lighthearted take themselves lightly

9
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:19,100
What are you afraid of?

10
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:25,370
If you go in and take a look, the truth will come out. Wang Jingjin, will you please?

11
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:30,880
preliminary judgment

12
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,680
It should be rat poison. Xiao Zhang takes the evidence bag.

13
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,760
Take it back and check it out

14
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:48,740
What's wrong with her, Miss Jiaojiao?

15
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,990
Me, my lady, can you explain me?

16
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:54,030
Why is there rat poison in your storage room?

17
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,260
Youyou brought it from the countryside

18
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:59,260
She blames me, Wang Ma, for being shameless

19
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:02,900
Youyou is only three and a half years old. How could she frame you?

20
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:06,900
Maybe Grandma Youyou has arrived now

21
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:08,500
Do you still think it’s Yoyo’s fault?
